<title>Myanmar's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/myanmar/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-myanmar-2026-11-21T19:35:09.017Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:35:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The International Court of Justice has ruled that Myanmar committed genocide against the Rohingya, a verdict the junta has denounced as unfair while rights groups call for sanctions. The junta has intensified its campaign by destroying bridges in Arakan, advancing west of the Sittaung River, planning a 108‑kilometre fence on the Bangladesh border, and conducting an airstrike on a displacement camp in Rakhine, while Sagaing saw junta forces kill 11 people and Starlink outages isolated communities as health facilities continued to be attacked in October 2026. Rohingya activists say their struggle for justice remains unfinished. There were 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/19/world/europe/myanmar-genocide-icj-decision-.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/21/rohingya-who-escaped-myanmars-genocide-tell-their-stories&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Frontline Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168853&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/law/2026/nov/20/us-eu-reaction-myanmar-rohingya-genocide-icj-ruling-trump-international-law&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOcVY0LUZJSnV1ME83aWZYRUxCcUNxeUFMc3EzbkJoSGtRcHRuVjc